  "body": "Step into home ownership or investment with confidence in the sought-after Strathmill development in Orewa. As a House & Land package, you'll enjoy a simple, stress-free path to owning a brand-new home-designed for modern living and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nPerfect for first-home buyers, this is your chance to get on the property ladder in a thriving, up-and-coming community. With exceptional value, this home delivers lifestyle and long-term potential in one of Orewa's most exciting new neighborhoods. \r\n\r\n* 3 well-proportioned bedrooms\r\n* Master bedroom includes ensuite\r\n* 2 modern bathrooms (including ensuite)\r\n* 1 off road car parking \r\n* Open plan kitchen and dining flowing onto the outdoor living\r\n\r\nYou're only minutes away from Orewa beach, boutique shops, boardwalk cafes and schools.  Enjoy easy access to the motorway north and south if you're living this coastal lifestyle and work further a field. \r\n \r\nStrathmill Orewa development is off West Hoe Heights (Western end).  \r\n\r\nCall us now to discuss how this House and Land Package can benefit you.",
